row.cell:
William,
b. 1650;
em. to America;
m. 10 Nov., 1676 to Anne Sewall;
d. 31 Oct., 1690.

Stephen (1),
b. 22 Sept., 1685;
m. 13 Mar., 1713 to Abigail Tompson;
d. 17 Nov., 1764.

Stephen (2),
b. 7 Feb., 1723;
(H. C., 1742)
(Portland, 1745);
m. 19 Oct., 1749 to Tabitha Bragdon;
d. Gorham, 1 May, 1790.

Stephen (3),
b. 3 Aug., 1750;
m. 13 Dec., 1773 to Patience Young;
d. Gorham, 1824.

Stephen (4),
b. 23 Mar., 1776;
(H. C., 1798)
m. 1 Jan., 1804 to Zilpah Wadsworth;
d. ——, Aug., 1849.

Henry W.
b. 27 Feb., 1807;
m. (1) 14 Sept., 1831 to Mary S. Potter;
(2) 13 July, 1843 to Frances E. Appleton;
d. 24 Mar., 1882.
